**C**
```c
for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
    printf("%d\n", i);
}
```
**Java**
```java
for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
    System.out.println(i);
}
```
**Python**
```python
for i in range(10):
    print(i)
```
**JavaScript**
```javascript
for (var i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
    console.log(i);
}
```
